  message: "Fixed in PR #2267 (merged). Close condition met: the pre-PR's last smart-test run ingested with the fixed code at 2026-11-19T00:54:50Z, and test_timings.json now holds 41,676 keys, 0 matching _BROKEN_KEY (was 12,647 of 41,671). Module-level functions are keyed by node id, e.g. tests/test_test_leaderboard.py::test_node_ids_are_pytests (run recorded 00:54:50Z). Root cause: _parse_junit_xml read junit classname's last dotted part as a class even when it was the module; it now takes the last part starting test_/BRANCHES_test_ as the module. Old broken keys are repaired on load and their runs merged."  # a0e9
